howl-report 2
profile el
verdict incoherent
termination fixpoint
rounds 3
inconsistent false
omitted 0
unsatisfiable 2
unsat http://example.org/t#A
unsat http://example.org/t#B
subsumptions 3
sub http://example.org/t#A http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Nothing
sub http://example.org/t#B http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Nothing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 1
